            "review_title": "Review at Mai Vang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Louise\nBexley, United Kingdom551 contributions\n0\nNot good\nDec 2018 • Couples\nI certainly wouldn't recommend eating here. The food was below average and the service poor. There was nothing meat-free on the menu, so I asked for vegetable fried rice. They brought a dish which contained meat but the waitress insisted that there was none - despite me picking the bits out to show her. Others in our group who had meat dishes couldn't eat their meals as it wasn't good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 19, 2018",
